    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21c72d609f2d75c84c3d41ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dfa8f51a3a406f9865d0b16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我也跟美丽周日一起努力训练。\n要是顺利缔造好成绩，\n或许能借此为富士奇石加油打气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e02824103726d042081cebac2334ef1c81aa23ecf90c710ae87877a541960378",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81814cd8d22918b4b9b76684",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总有一天能产生连结的美丽",
      "source_fingerprint": "52598b5184346c86c4b9da6de58f975cbc4d8a07d800ee338024bdd774e3d91b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0212b98b5dca38d45d72531e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "视为目标的“挑战杯”即将到来，\n但这次美丽周日的左脚却受了伤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee3c163b77e294117ffb642d30e18ad6137a4b0b69b15377cb29597031f6bb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d79de7ee31ef944fa6db467",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至今她无论遭遇何种困难都能够\n以乐观积极的心态面对，但这次\n她的笑容却蒙上阴影，显得脆弱又消沉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dec8285ceb05f2778b5958b2974b3e183ad96e5ed92a4c832b504939bf4e7de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a624adc05fa3670411eebe57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过──一直为她加油的学生们、\n在病房邂逅的少年、镇上人们，\n每个人都诚心希望她能恢复健康。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c68b35837902df77455aec9747ad20f3c5615275a51e86f442c8299b844321",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d5bc55b80c18c2cf12a540",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这些都是自己亲手催生萌芽的美丽。\n如今这些美丽激励着她。\n她脸上表情再度绽放光彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1186702180664c7610f3948281c8d87e2aba76a2c7fa070b22dd002c388448f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bc526b92510b71019260320",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "照亮你的美丽",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0fb4db2d6777baa5171d6aa90fe214b83ce3796a3bcf2341f76c8b858283197",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:280807a1e6285d90f946b79d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”参赛者记者会当天，\n至今共同一路走来的竞争对手们现身会场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d40a13c13d75d88306609f28a1d7c4b493f67d539ef32e2a6d7545ce53dde363",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60cf1033deebdc649e98d3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每一位都是曾经收下美丽后，\n带着美丽走上各自道路的竞争对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8adfb3d031a7791de98943fcb81b77208606f08a0d62ee052040c863f33ee2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:748a765d16f8f92560532cc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如今又各自成为更加耀眼的美丽，\n回到年底的中山齐聚一堂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c593830c0db97c5b2984db77606a4ab1fb83e533f0f719fd45a5f41dd21108",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce94d74182c8b8feca5785f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "垄罩全世界的\n“世界美丽化计划”最后关键。\n即将要与竞争对手们决战“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "473c2461aef3cab5f8e724beb7d882834979cb9f30d5dea7097c1ce6376b9f39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049f44f4f07ea2e4f4617857",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽的光源",
      "source_fingerprint": "7322ba804e3af2ee244cc2632706e0155d37a9f91b0a0161b11204349cb01953",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cefac4463b210b975f5d86e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b11eee2aa1528f7dfc314237",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园的例行活动夏季集训到来了。\n因伤选择不参加“天皇赏（春）”的\n成田白仁也出席了今年集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "323a7df219df2cf26fb5ee1e172f5419dfe3095176c02afd0e8cf9e02d8e5689",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a77942c6321a1d167654781f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829a7c47dcfff46ce612f1db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日与重炮似乎也相当期待\n能与重回赛道的成田白仁一同赛跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f004948d0d0d955aef5ab1750f4dbabe4fe8fb07032f4026225621c76948b27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e35593c6f4a5d1c310d5de55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94e6ece5f4a9388608c441c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有樱花桂冠独自一人\n带着难以言喻的表情凝视成田白仁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed6a4ca9c7aae902fb0a2d76bd86958e0e0c87e8efaacdee29c34b5ac378a44c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe4e4da9ade0b2505f9f1f99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055406.json",
