    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:169fdce34c7b50395c30b549",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年也到了夏季集训的季节。\n不过去年曾在同一片沙滩上奔跑的竞争对手们\n今年却不在身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68f21ba8c90fe291136b61765bbffa00be710187662dbf23cab1bd450879ad21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dc598f20b054b6157a59d18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f71dd4f7dd7c09e6ea19bc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众人皆各自找到自己的美丽，持续奔跑。\n趁着这个夏天磨练出不输他人的光辉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc0cd472bbaa4f7fad8f9bc8ff771692f3185922c5b9ef1b5654900cb5b33f69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055407.json",
      "json_path": [
