    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2c2c49c62387a58f71ebd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她一有机会便大力宣扬美丽，令观众感到困惑。\n但这也无可奈何，毕竟大家都尚未知晓\n美丽蕴藏的可能性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a36ced8cf6f9dabf158c8217efea2399d99194b0d59a39ddfc313cbdafb9bd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
