    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e0859187fb270fff51d50b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81bcb1890edb1c797696dc47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日的状态调整\n进行得很顺利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aa31b9d4d9bacd32c0c913779e2fe1574b242a887ff73cfc7cb15086cce40a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b26dd60b455a7efeb0083f80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟未能累积足够训练的\n经典级前半期比起来，\n现在的她现在实力有了大幅提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e107da7991794b70988bd834fe3da9b91ac6e564f1ad755cddac15db2fc72be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4327042a93eb8bb18b433f61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日用充满热情的双眼\n紧盯着练习中的重炮。相信现在\n她的实力已经足以登上大舞台一决胜负了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1cf9799d5198ffe18674c3c3aebd15986d8bc81dbcd6cc0958316ae619aa7b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d016284dd6e378b77431ed0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "借由“菊花赏”一赛，\n让全世界尽情体会何谓美丽吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01eec1d844e386707509e7f945e81f106e5aaf0dab144af7989d4e2423c1f67f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b66066e810ec678b84c5271",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32fe703b345a297a6972e4f3115aec53ea8a9931382257ccb6b146928c5537e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
