    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84949b0755b6bc7347843355",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟美丽周日一起努力复健成果见效了。\n如今她双脚状态甚至更胜以往。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdc236574dda648b6cd449fc54eda3da71935b45cc678b0e60d3440009a8938d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
