    {
      "uid": "zhcn:253571a7b2195624ad3f4fa9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然这一路走来绝非一帆风顺，\n但面临比赛已准备得万无一失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dfb390c8dce7e2fec06183dab11d007aefcca0ac4f78363b6e1b0e753612fd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
