    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d6c659f1e9fbdfa69a05ea7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她带着满心的美丽努力完成复健，\n此刻面前再无一丝忧虑。\n──放手挑战“挑战杯”吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0f846742040555d996a1e3e9584e1442467577046125641f5332cd721c6f43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
