    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d2b479b172688026898ff8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世间感叹着“怪物”或许到此为止了，\n但身处其中的她仍然埋头进行严苛训练，\n那身影简直就像在苦苦挣扎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83b474c6a83d724d52b8a2e06dac88faa4730cace2fb552dd31e1908177b6f93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
