    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8431ef6e9b5e95d13fec596e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想必美丽周日一定能\n在这一片混沌之中找出美丽吧。\n经典级的最后一场竞赛即将开跑──",
      "source_fingerprint": "52d397228b2ae3344765d1c727e4af6aad3790ebd03b32b0cf7680f341c73256",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
