    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf9b5457bd507a8d04202f74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "视为目标的春古马三冠初战\n“大阪杯”当天──\n即将登上大舞台的美丽周日鼓足干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc65d9d73d6eec42fbea6e00db3b98128158e1833f1f22dd8b16560924406e63",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90628d321897a95acfb7c6df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那干劲也是其来有自。毕竟大阪杯结束后\n就是“天皇赏（春）”了，而在重赏比赛持续\n创下好成绩的樱花桂冠与──",
      "source_fingerprint": "233a647af307282f14ed62d8c72f78d80173a9d5f6d761b4c2de3f1dfcadc871",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f81e332305f436cb5eb2ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他实力卓越的选手们皆已正式发表\n即将参赛。即将到来的美丽比赛\n令美丽周日感到满心雀跃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "434d63b787e92a6855a6f20210f1d0b7e77744900d9ffe45f950a2450532d109",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
