    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e328bd1b0bd258f1b28bd26f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面临“天皇赏（春）”──春季资深\n三冠第二战，同时更是强者云集的比赛，\n美丽周日显得难掩兴奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "729e62ce23042e9bbd5ab178945401dcbadfc250d52922d75d9f23f1810c6ee0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
