      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "追求闪闪发光的比赛的重炮、\n曾数度因受伤落泪但仍东山再起的樱花桂冠，\n还有──",
      "source_fingerprint": "349df2d24a3cc08b519077ecbe43ad9cb68cf41406508c14c9c3a94d58dc0c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
