      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连“曾经”被公认为\n时代的中心的成田白仁都克服了伤势，受伤站上这个大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "063365407a89b951b26445f66a3e8264a1125d04bfb563e514c14f3f5a47d687",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
