      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够在此刻、同一场比赛一起奔跑的奇迹。\n最无与伦比的美丽一战即将展开……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "081b1b78f9577f666dae9c123a7a7738df206a5e8107d1a965cdbcb61a3d8316",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
